        type: "nav-button"
        content: "← Back to Home"
        action: "navigate"
        targetContainerId: "screen-home"
        css: "background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 30px; border: none; cursor: pointer; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);"

      - ::
        type: "section-container"
        name: "About Container"
        css: "max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);"
        children::
          - ::
            type: "heading"
            content: "About Tech Insights Blog"
            css: "color: #1a202c; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 800;"

          - ::
            type: "markdown-text"
            content: "## Welcome! 👋\n\nTech Insights is a blog exploring the cutting edge of web development, focusing on:\n\n- **Modern Frameworks** - Svelte, React, Vue\n- **Real-time Collaboration** - Yjs, WebSockets, CRDTs\n- **Developer Tools** - Build tools, languages, IDEs\n- **Architecture** - Patterns, best practices, design\n\n## Who We Are\n\nWe're a team of developers passionate about:\n\n✨ **Innovation** - Trying new technologies  \n🔧 **Building** - Creating useful tools  \n📚 **Learning** - Continuous growth  \n🤝 **Sharing** - Open source & community\n\n## Join the Discussion\n\nEvery post has a comment thread where you can:\n- Share your thoughts\n- Ask questions\n- Discuss implementations\n- Connect with other developers\n\n## Built With\n\nThis blog itself is built using the technologies we write about:\n- **Svelte 5** with Runes for reactivity\n- **Yjs** for collaborative comments\n- **HUML** for declarative UI definition\n- **Markdown** for rich content\n\nThe entire blog is defined in a single HUML template file!\n\n---\n\n**Stay curious. Keep building. Share knowledge.** 🚀"
            mode: "markdown"
            css: "line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3748;"
